Description:You control Tobias Andrion, Magebane Armor enchanted with Rune of Flight, an Island and a Plains, and have Jump in hand. The opponent is at 6 life and controls Wall of Stone. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:rulesguru-ba2da7f391d32917 | Ability-adding and ability-removing effects apply in timestamp order in layer 6 (CR 613.7, 613.7a): the "equipped creature has flying" Rune of Flight grants the Armor applies after the Armor's own "loses flying", so equipped Tobias is a 6/8 flier
